WEBVTT

00:00:01.680 --> 00:00:10.530
Apollon, do you remember the day the world began?

00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:13.950
A miracle filled the sacred and formless void

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:19.150
with over a billion galaxies, each with over a billion stars.

00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:20.680
A miracle?

00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:29.210
Yes. The miracle of our meeting above this world.

00:00:30.290 --> 00:00:31.670
Silvie!

00:00:32.300 --> 00:00:35.430
Now we begin to walk a new path.

00:00:47.490 --> 00:00:50.080
<i>Skies of Aquaria</i> again?

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:52.230
Sorry, sir! I'll clean up right—

00:00:52.230 --> 00:00:55.820
You're the only reason it keeps getting shown, you know.

00:00:55.820 --> 00:00:58.930
No one else cares about it one bit.

00:01:01.170 --> 00:01:05.380
I'll never forget how lovely you smell.

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:08.490
What's so great about this movie, anyway?

00:01:09.170 --> 00:01:13.420
I bet you fancy Alicia, the girl who played Silvie.

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:18.980
You can't just watch as destiny flies off...

00:01:19.750 --> 00:01:23.540
That's all I can I think of when I see her.

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:25.690
You're a strange one.

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:28.820
I'll take over loading the films.

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:30.840
Go take a break, Amata.

00:01:30.840 --> 00:01:33.720
Just clean up the seats before you go.

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:35.190
Thank you, sir!

00:01:38.190 --> 00:01:41.280
I'll be waiting for you.

00:01:42.360 --> 00:01:47.160
Even if I have to wait for 12,000 years.

00:01:58.410 --> 00:02:00.720
Damn, there's still trash down here.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.920
This sucks.

00:02:10.010 --> 00:02:11.410
E-Excuse me...

00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:25.000
I'm sorry! I'll leave now!

00:02:32.710 --> 00:02:33.860
Wait!

00:02:39.760 --> 00:02:43.300
Are you a fan... of <i>Skies of Aquaria</i>?

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:46.290
Oh, no. This is the first time I've seen it.

00:02:47.270 --> 00:02:49.420
Oh. Okay.

00:02:50.600 --> 00:02:52.130
Well, then...

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:53.080
Wait!

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:56.430
Um, could you please tell me your name? Maybe?

00:02:58.530 --> 00:03:01.110
I'm Mikono Suzushiro.

00:03:01.110 --> 00:03:03.620
My name is Amata! Amata Sora!

00:03:04.140 --> 00:03:06.430
Oh.

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:13.130
Um...

00:03:13.130 --> 00:03:14.380
Yes?

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:18.520
Thank you for visiting our theater today.

00:03:22.990 --> 00:03:23.990
Excuse me...

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:27.090
Do you sell pamphlets for this movie?

00:03:27.090 --> 00:03:31.940
Sorry. It's over ten years old. They don't make them anymore.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:36.480
Then, would you mind talking to me for a while?

00:03:37.180 --> 00:03:40.370
I want to hear more about <i>Skies of Aquaria</i>.

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:42.860
Really?

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:46.860
But I need to finish up some work, and...

00:03:47.690 --> 00:03:50.780
I'll be waiting for you.

00:03:50.780 --> 00:03:53.620
Even if I have to wait for 12,000 years.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.200
Just kidding.

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:57.840
I just wanted to say that.

00:04:02.990 --> 00:04:06.010
Damn it! No! Not now!

00:04:10.920 --> 00:04:13.030
Do you mind waiting just outside?

00:04:13.030 --> 00:04:15.980
I'll be out in five, no, three minutes!

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:30.580
Three in each should be enough.

00:04:32.190 --> 00:04:34.460
I can't believe she spoke to me.

00:04:35.150 --> 00:04:38.210
And she's cute to boot. I must be dreaming.

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:53.560
Stop! Don't go! Don't go away!

00:04:54.580 --> 00:04:58.000
That day, I could only watch as destiny flew away.

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:02.760
But I'm different now.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:06.980
Don't freak out, Amata.

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:08.570
She did say...

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:13.690
I'll be waiting for you.

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:17.080
Even if I have to wait for 12,000 years.

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:23.630
Let us on, Mister!

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:44.070
<i>New China City's traffic core was paralyzed in an Abductor attack. Repairs are underway...</i>

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.200
The Abductors attacked again.

00:05:46.200 --> 00:05:47.400
Sounds like it.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:51.570
Those Abductors are making this place too quiet.

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:53.910
The theater's customers are drying up.

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:56.790
You never know when, or where they'll attack next.

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:00.250
The Aquarias fight them off, but they just keep on coming.

00:06:01.140 --> 00:06:06.370
Abductors or not, I can't stand being cooped up at home.

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:08.210
I have to get some sun!

00:06:08.210 --> 00:06:10.160
That's some optimistic thinking.

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:13.110
Most people call it stupid.

00:06:15.410 --> 00:06:15.980
Are you okay?

00:06:21.680 --> 00:06:22.770
What the hell is that?!

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:23.820
I'm sorry!

00:06:25.970 --> 00:06:28.180
This is my cat, Shush.

00:06:28.180 --> 00:06:31.030
I think he likes being in my hair.

00:06:31.030 --> 00:06:33.120
That's a cat?

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:34.620
Of course it's a cat!

00:06:35.280 --> 00:06:37.640
Pretty weird-looking cat.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:40.870
I found him running from the Abductors.

00:06:41.980 --> 00:06:44.760
Oh, yeah! Tell me about the movie!

00:06:45.540 --> 00:06:46.260
All right.

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:49.100
<i>Skies of Aquaria</i>.

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:51.250
It's based on a book about a war with the Dark Angels

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:54.310
that supposedly took place a long time ago.

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:57.550
That children's story about what
happened 12,000 years ago?

00:06:57.550 --> 00:07:00.050
Yeah, the movie didn't do that well,

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:02.230
but the theme song won awards at film festivals.

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:04.750
Oh, I love that song!

00:07:04.750 --> 00:07:07.320
The singer was the girl who played Silvie...

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.280
Her name's Alicia, right?

00:07:09.700 --> 00:07:12.030
She's a great actress! She seemed really nice,

00:07:12.650 --> 00:07:15.200
and she's so pretty!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:17.550
Yeah, she's pretty...

00:07:18.300 --> 00:07:20.280
She's so pretty that it's sad.

00:07:21.720 --> 00:07:24.040
Aah! Shush, don't eat the whole thing!

00:07:24.040 --> 00:07:25.930
Aw...

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:35.480
Did you know, Amata?

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:38.020
Supposedly, somewhere, there's a school that trains Elements,

00:07:38.020 --> 00:07:42.140
the people who pilot the Aquarias.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:48.410
Only people who've been chosen by the Aquarias and granted special powers can go there.

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:51.330
People like Apollon and Silvie.

00:07:52.010 --> 00:07:55.620
Amata, have you ever wanted to pilot an Aquaria?

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:02.870
I guess I've thought about it.

00:08:03.650 --> 00:08:06.920
But I'd never be chosen by anybody.

00:08:07.670 --> 00:08:09.460
I'm totally useless.

00:08:11.040 --> 00:08:12.360
Oh, well...

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:14.610
Me, too.

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:17.340
I'm completely useless.

00:08:18.140 --> 00:08:20.810
We're a useless pair!

00:08:25.080 --> 00:08:27.090
I'm gonna go to the bathroom!

00:08:27.090 --> 00:08:28.420
Go on ahead! I'll catch up!

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:41.680
Respond, Kagura. Stop fooling around.

00:08:42.220 --> 00:08:44.750
That Mithra Gnis is just a test model.

00:08:44.750 --> 00:08:47.290
The objective of this mission is strictly surveillance only.

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:53.340
It smells good.

00:08:54.550 --> 00:08:56.220
This must be Vega.

00:09:02.280 --> 00:09:05.870
Eight, nine, ten.

00:09:09.160 --> 00:09:11.390
"Useless pair," she says.

00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:15.650
Depressing words, but when she says them so cheerfully...

00:09:15.650 --> 00:09:17.130
It makes me feel happy.

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:19.560
How long ya gonna be in there?

00:09:19.560 --> 00:09:22.220
Daddy, I can't hold it anymore! I gotta go!

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:23.840
I'm so sorry!

00:09:27.890 --> 00:09:30.040
I'll be out right away!

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:32.840
What's going on?

00:09:45.400 --> 00:09:46.350
Abductors!

00:10:37.350 --> 00:10:38.650
Mikono!

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:41.360
This way! To the shelter!

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.240
Mikono!

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.280
It's an Aquaria!

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:26.740
These Abductors just don't know when to quit!

00:11:27.090 --> 00:11:29.470
Every time we chase 'em off, they come back with more!

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:31.530
Enough with the chitchat, Andy.

00:11:31.530 --> 00:11:35.390
We'll intercept them with the Aquaria Type-M!

00:11:35.390 --> 00:11:36.420
Roger that.

00:11:37.010 --> 00:11:39.300
May the legend guide our hands.

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:43.340
They've certainly brought quite a party with them.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:45.540
There's heavy damage at ground zero.

00:11:45.540 --> 00:11:47.930
Mr. Principal! I mean, Commander!

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:52.280
Don't you think those boys out there have terrible discipline?

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:56.650
Discipline? As if you could claim your girls are any better!

00:11:56.650 --> 00:11:59.950
A large Abductor unit is approaching the battlefield!

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:01.650
There's no data on it! We've never seen it before!

00:12:01.650 --> 00:12:02.650
What?

00:12:09.950 --> 00:12:11.160
What is that thing?

00:12:11.160 --> 00:12:12.860
We've never seen that machine before!

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:24.340
It's fast!

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:26.850
This thing's on a whole new level!

00:12:26.850 --> 00:12:29.100
It's stronger and faster than anything we've faced!

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:37.230
We're reading vital signs from inside the enemy machine!

00:12:37.230 --> 00:12:37.940
What?

00:12:38.320 --> 00:12:40.160
It's piloted!

00:12:40.160 --> 00:12:42.190
A being from another dimension!

00:12:42.190 --> 00:12:43.280
Damn you!

00:12:48.280 --> 00:12:50.720
It's fighting in circles around the Aquaria.

00:12:50.720 --> 00:12:53.710
It's like that Abductor's playing with it!

00:12:59.850 --> 00:13:00.630
This is bad!

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:02.630
The Vectors are taking heavy damage!

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:04.260
Tachyon levels falling!

00:13:04.260 --> 00:13:06.680
Mr. Principal! I mean, Commander!

00:13:10.060 --> 00:13:11.020
What?

00:13:17.380 --> 00:13:19.870
Understood. Roger.

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:24.700
We're authorized to deploy the Type-F.

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:25.290
What?

00:13:25.290 --> 00:13:26.200
Are you serious?

00:13:26.200 --> 00:13:29.140
We're going to have the Type-M and
the Type-F operating at the same time?

00:13:29.140 --> 00:13:31.870
Commander! You know this is forbidden!

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:35.820
We can't let the Type-M be destroyed.

00:13:35.820 --> 00:13:37.120
Get that Type-F out there.

00:13:44.130 --> 00:13:45.590
Target acquired!

00:13:45.590 --> 00:13:47.580
Missiles, locked on!

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:03.570
The Type-F?

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:12.620
We meet at last, boys.

00:14:12.620 --> 00:14:17.380
Boys are so rough when they fight. It just looks disgusting.

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:20.250
Cayenne! It's really you!

00:14:20.250 --> 00:14:22.610
Look! Girls!

00:14:22.610 --> 00:14:24.730
Professor, is this okay?

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.720
We're in trouble now.

00:14:27.720 --> 00:14:29.660
We can only pray that the worst does not come to pass.

00:14:29.660 --> 00:14:32.230
That the boys and girls do not come together in Union...

00:14:32.230 --> 00:14:36.350
No matter how close they get, they are doomed to never touch.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:41.020
The barrier of chastity, the Guize Stones will see to that!

00:14:45.740 --> 00:14:49.570
Well, isn't that funny. The new prey smells different.

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:52.070
We'll catch him in a pincer attack!

00:14:52.070 --> 00:14:53.870
Got it! Don't tell me what to do!

00:14:58.990 --> 00:15:00.880
Hold still already!

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:12.910
Damn, he's tough!

00:15:12.910 --> 00:15:15.060
Stupid boys! Get out of our way!

00:15:15.060 --> 00:15:15.680
What'd you say?

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:17.430
Are they even trying to cooperate?

00:15:17.430 --> 00:15:18.950
Not likely.

00:15:19.500 --> 00:15:21.850
This is their first time.

00:15:26.860 --> 00:15:28.900
What is it doing?

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:46.290
Get us down, Mix!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:47.280
Roger!

00:15:51.860 --> 00:15:54.230
Are you okay, Mikono?

00:15:58.780 --> 00:16:00.310
Amata! You're bleeding!

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:02.020
Don't worry about it.

00:16:02.020 --> 00:16:03.200
But...

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:06.340
This is just my body... It's nothing...

00:16:07.020 --> 00:16:11.240
I'd rather my body get hurt... than my heart...

00:16:16.020 --> 00:16:18.330
Type-M, do you read? Come back us up!

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:21.250
Not happening! Malloy's taken serious damage!

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:22.620
His machine's out of power!

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:25.100
How pathetic! You boys can't even—

00:16:25.100 --> 00:16:26.040
Watch out!

00:16:30.500 --> 00:16:31.920
It's on all fours!

00:16:58.580 --> 00:16:59.530
That's...

00:17:00.570 --> 00:17:01.540
What's going on?

00:17:06.890 --> 00:17:08.030
Huh?

00:17:13.590 --> 00:17:14.590
Mikono!

00:17:15.520 --> 00:17:18.490
Amata! Stop! You're hurt!

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:23.020
Mikono!

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:30.570
Their aura levels are dropping sharply!

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:31.440
What?

00:17:32.210 --> 00:17:33.830
The Unions are breaking!

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:36.950
The Aquarias!

00:17:38.080 --> 00:17:40.200
I can't hold back any longer.

00:17:40.200 --> 00:17:41.200
What?

00:17:47.160 --> 00:17:48.920
Mix! Sazanka!

00:17:48.920 --> 00:17:49.460
Andy!

00:17:50.100 --> 00:17:52.530
What are you doing? Who told you to come back?

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:56.290
I dunno! I got pulled back here!

00:17:57.310 --> 00:17:59.340
I can still fight!

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:01.090
Mix?

00:18:01.090 --> 00:18:05.060
The Aquarias ejected the Elements on their own?

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:13.650
I'm sorry, Mikono.

00:18:18.560 --> 00:18:20.950
Amata? Sorry for what?

00:18:24.910 --> 00:18:28.670
I just wanted to protect you!

00:18:29.620 --> 00:18:32.170
I'm sorry!

00:18:40.640 --> 00:18:43.430
Fly!

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.450
The Wings of the Sun!

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:22.970
Detecting vital signs from inside Vector Z!

00:19:23.910 --> 00:19:27.160
Someone snuck in?

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:28.480
Did a terrorist hijack the Vector?

00:19:28.480 --> 00:19:30.640
Is that a boy and a girl? But how?

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.590
Quickly! Eject them!

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:33.310
Yes, ma'am!

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:39.690
I can't! Their life energy has merged with the Vector's power!

00:19:41.040 --> 00:19:44.070
What if those two were called by...

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:44.950
Aquarion?

00:19:45.530 --> 00:19:46.370
Impossible!

00:19:47.070 --> 00:19:48.840
Where are we?

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:51.600
This must be a Vector cockpit.

00:19:52.340 --> 00:19:53.390
How?

00:19:54.380 --> 00:19:56.630
I don't know how...

00:19:57.380 --> 00:20:00.380
But I feel like I know

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:03.010
what I have to do!

00:20:04.580 --> 00:20:05.900
Amata?

00:20:10.230 --> 00:20:11.510
We've gotta stop him!

00:20:11.510 --> 00:20:12.440
I know already!

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:15.560
Shatter the name of falsehood.

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:18.360
And as it shatters, speak.

00:20:18.360 --> 00:20:20.220
Speak the name of truth!

00:20:20.820 --> 00:20:24.450
And so, you will inherit a new legend!

00:20:25.280 --> 00:20:26.910
The name of truth...

00:20:28.080 --> 00:20:29.740
The name of truth?

00:20:29.740 --> 00:20:34.830
Yes. I have to speak the name of truth.

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:39.590
Genesis Union!

00:20:39.590 --> 00:20:42.970
Go, Aquarion!

00:20:50.180 --> 00:20:51.100
What?

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:53.230
Did he say Aquarion?

00:20:54.260 --> 00:20:55.730
What does that mean?

00:20:55.730 --> 00:20:59.480
Aquarion. He knows the forbidden name...

00:21:05.860 --> 00:21:09.620
No! Stop! This Union...

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.500
I've never felt like this before...

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:20.000
Commander, what is Aquarion? Tell me!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:22.880
It's all right! They have the Guize Stones!

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:24.880
They can't complete the forbidden Union!

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:30.390
I'm being torn apart!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:34.270
If this keeps up, our restraint and emotions will be torn apart!

00:21:34.270 --> 00:21:36.900
We'll be torn apart... and then burst!

00:21:38.280 --> 00:21:42.570
I'm going to burst! Something in me is going to burst...

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:47.740
It's breaking!

00:22:02.550 --> 00:22:05.240
What is that thing?

00:22:05.240 --> 00:22:07.930
Aquarion is... evolving!

00:22:08.540 --> 00:22:10.930
Aquarion Evol!

00:22:16.430 --> 00:22:18.650
What's that smell?

00:22:20.660 --> 00:22:23.150
It smells... awful.

00:22:24.740 --> 00:22:27.900
The forbidden name, engraved now unto a new body.

00:22:29.350 --> 00:22:30.660
Aquarion Evol!

00:22:32.920 --> 00:22:38.050
The legend of the end is about to begin.

00:24:11.220 --> 00:24:16.050
When I make ramen, I usually wait longer than I'm supposed to.

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:18.130
Sodden noodles are...

00:24:18.130 --> 00:24:19.720
soft!

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:23.980
Next time on Aquarion Evol,
The Forbidden Union.
